<div class="post" id="post-3632">
	 <span class="posted-by">December 10th 2010</span>
	 <h2 class="storytitle"><a href="http://blog.roblox.com/?p=3632" rel="bookmark">What did you sleigh?</a></h2>
	
	<div class="storycontent">
		<p>Santa Claus is famous for his cookie-eating, toy-sack-hauling, and epic sleigh-driving tactics (I mean, he gets around the world in a single night, while still stopping to eat loads of cookies!).  Does Santa use gearz?  Nobody knows&#8230;  But we made him some, just in case.<a href=""><img class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-3012" title="Sleigh Battle?  Battle Sleigh!" alt="Sleigh Battle?  Battle Sleigh!" src="http://blog.roblox.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/12/BattleSleighCapture.jpg" width="484" height="216" /></a></p>
<p><a href="/p/Catalog.aspx"><img class="alignleft size-full wp-image-2987" title="Xmas Cookie" alt="Xmas Cookie" src="http://blog.roblox.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/12/XMasCookieIcon.png" width="128" height="128" /></a><strong><a href="/p/Catalog.aspx" target="_blank">X-mas Cookie</a> &#8211; </strong>They call it sugar cookie, we call it &#8220;i can haz?&#8221;</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p><a href="/p/Catalog.aspx"><img class="alignleft size-full wp-image-2993" title="Santa's Big Bag O' Toys" alt="Santa's Big Bag O' Toys" src="http://blog.roblox.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/12/SantaSackIcon.png" width="128" height="128" /></a><strong><a href="/p/Catalog.aspx" target="_blank">Santa&#8217;s Big Bag O&#8217; Toys</a> &#8211; </strong>How does Santa fit so many toys in that bag of his?  After careful scientific analysis of fibers from Santa&#8217;s suit, we have determined that we have no idea.  But we&#8217;re fans!</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p><a href="/p/Catalog.aspx"><img class="alignleft size-full wp-image-2993" title="Battle Sleigh" alt="Battle Sleigh" src="http://blog.roblox.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/12/battleSleighIcon.png" width="128" height="128" /></a><strong><a href="/p/Catalog.aspx" target="_blank">BATTLE SLEIGH!</a> &#8211; </strong>With our holiday rendition of the classic BattleWagons game, you&#8217;ll be dashing through the snow, in a one-horse open BATTLE SLEIGH!  There can only be one Santa.</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p><a href="/p/Catalog.aspx"><img class="alignleft size-full wp-image-2993" title="Frosty Friend" alt="Frosty Friend" src="http://blog.roblox.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/12/frostyIcon.png" width="128" height="128" /></a><strong><a href="/p/Catalog.aspx" target="_blank">Frosty Friend (BC Only)</a> &#8211; </strong>This little guy is the best friend&#8211; he has such a warm heart!  Which is a problem when you&#8217;re made of ice and snow&#8230;  Wait a second&#8211;how did he get out of the snowglobe anyways!?</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p>Please discuss the new gear in the <a href="http://www.roblox.com/Forum/ShowPost.aspx?PostID=38462965">forums</a>.</p>
<p align="right">- HotThoth</p>
<!-- AddThis Bookmark Post Button BEGIN -->
<div><a href="http://www.addthis.com/bookmark.php?pub=Telamon&url=http://blog.roblox.com/?p=3632&title=What did you sleigh?" title="Bookmark using any bookmark manager!" target="_blank"><img src="http://s9.addthis.com/button1-bm.gif" width="125" height="16" border="0" alt="AddThis Social Bookmark Button" /></a></div><!-- AddThis Bookmark Post Button END -->
<br>
