<div class="post" id="post-3628">
	 <span class="posted-by">December 9th 2010</span>
	 <h2 class="storytitle"><a href="http://blog.roblox.com/?p=3628" rel="bookmark">Frosty Winter Collector&rsquo;s Gift</a></h2>
	
	<div class="storycontent">
		<p><img style="display: inline; float: right" alt="?" align="right" src="/ext/t5bg.roblox.com/98f3bf520c7c6d7e1cc6020a4f4de494" width="134" height="134" /></p>
<p>Own any six of the following collectible items on Monday Dec 13th to win the <a href="http://www.roblox.com/Frosty-Winter-Collectors-Gift-item?id=41781308">Frosty Winter Collector’s Gift</a>! Figure these out before your fellow ROBLOXians bid up the price on these collectibles!</p>
<ol>
<li>A particular saint who could star in Saw IV</li>
<li>A sinister skull-topper whose advice we abhor</li>
<li>This lucky hat rhymes with Milty Chick Pig</li>
<li>A cheap solar blocker conservationists dig</li>
<li>Not for our pilots, but still the most fly</li>
<li>A Chinese invention here in oversupply</li>
<li>Ugly survey prize you’d toss given your druthers </li>
<li>And the one collectible item, unlike all others</li>
</ol>
<p align="right">- Telamon</p>
<!-- AddThis Bookmark Post Button BEGIN -->
<div><a href="http://www.addthis.com/bookmark.php?pub=Telamon&url=http://blog.roblox.com/?p=3628&title=Frosty Winter Collector&rsquo;s Gift" title="Bookmark using any bookmark manager!" target="_blank"><img src="http://s9.addthis.com/button1-bm.gif" width="125" height="16" border="0" alt="AddThis Social Bookmark Button" /></a></div><!-- AddThis Bookmark Post Button END -->
<br>
	</div>
	
	<div class="post-footer">
		<div class="meta">Posted in: <a href="http://blog.roblox.com/?cat=8" title="View all posts in Contests" rel="category">Contests</a>, <a href="http://blog.roblox.com/?cat=1" title="View all posts in News" rel="category">News</a> </div>
