</div>


	
<div class="post" id="post-3608">
	 <span class="posted-by">December 6th 2010</span>
	 <h2 class="storytitle"><a href="http://blog.roblox.com/?p=3608" rel="bookmark">Retro ROBLOXian Gift of Yesteryore</a></h2>
	
	<div class="storycontent">
		<p><a href="/p/Retro-ROBLOXian-Gift-of-Yesteryore-item"><img style="margin: 8px 12px 8px 0px; display: inline" title="image" alt="image" src="http://blog.roblox.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/12/image6.png" width="500" height="344" /></a></p>
<p><strong>UPDATE:</strong></p>
<p><strong>It is now too late to get this gift for free. It has already gone out. If you’re quick, you may be able to <a href="/p/Retro-ROBLOXian-Gift-of-Yesteryore-item">buy a copy</a>.</strong></p>
<p><strong>&#8212;</strong></p>
<p>A mysterious time-traveling alien is visiting famous places from ROBLOXia’s deep past! If you find all the places he’s been and visit them before Monday, you’ll win an even more mysterious <a href="/p/Retro-ROBLOXian-Gift-of-Yesteryore-item">gift</a>!</p>
<h1>1.</h1>
<h1><a href="http://blog.roblox.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/12/image7.png"><img style="margin: 8px 12px 8px 0px; display: inline" title="image" alt="image" src="http://blog.roblox.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/12/image_thumb6.png" width="500" height="312" /></a></h1>
<h1>2.</h1>
<h1><a href="http://blog.roblox.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/12/image8.png"><img style="display: inline" title="image" alt="image" src="http://blog.roblox.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/12/image_thumb7.png" width="500" height="317" /></a></h1>
<h1>3.</h1>
<h1><a href="http://blog.roblox.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/12/image9.png"><img style="display: inline" title="image" alt="image" src="http://blog.roblox.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/12/image_thumb8.png" width="500" height="365" /></a></h1>
<h1>4.</h1>
<h1><a href="http://blog.roblox.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/12/image10.png"><img style="display: inline" title="image" alt="image" src="http://blog.roblox.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/12/image_thumb9.png" width="500" height="421" /></a></h1>
<h1>5.</h1>
<h1><a href="http://blog.roblox.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/12/image11.png"><img style="display: inline" title="image" alt="image" src="http://blog.roblox.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/12/image_thumb10.png" width="500" height="335" /></a></h1>
<h1>6.</h1>
<h1><a href="http://blog.roblox.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/12/image12.png"><img style="display: inline" title="image" alt="image" src="http://blog.roblox.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/12/image_thumb11.png" width="500" height="312" /></a></h1>
<h1>7.</h1>
<p><a href="http://blog.roblox.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/12/image13.png"><img style="display: inline" title="image" alt="image" src="http://blog.roblox.com/wp-content/uploads/2010/12/image_thumb12.png" width="500" height="375" /></a></p>
<p><strong>Details</strong></p>
<ol>
<li>You must visit the above places in multiplayer mode (not “play solo”) </li>
<li>Once you have visited all seven places, you won’t get the gift immediately. You won’t even be told that you correctly hit all the correct locations. Everyone who visited all the right places will be awarded the gift on Monday. </li>
<li>Some of these are hard. The <a href="/p/Forum/ShowForum.aspx">forums</a> are your friend. </li>
</ol>
<p align="right">- Telamon</p>
